  "details": "1. Drop a Print\n\n2. Pull out camera\n\n3. Point camera at Print\n\n4. Disable the \"Items\" option on the Mask settings\n\n5. Notice that the Print is still visible in the camera\n\n6. Disable the \"Remote User\" option on the Mask settings\n\n7. Notice that the Print is now hidden\n\nIt just makes more sense for Prints to be part of the Items layer. Some times you want to remove the Prints in the way of your camera, and it is currently impossible to hide them without hiding other players.",
